It's happened some times to me: the most memorable times were inside
sokoban levels. They can (and have) pick up ?oE and read them later.
Since monsters can be generated with items they can use, and
considering my past experiences, they can also surprise you by reading
a ?oE that was on their starting inventory.
Like many things on nethack, though, you can turn this to your
advantage. One time I messed sokoban (or there were monsters with
/oStriking, I don't remenber well) and the only way for advancing was
by getting new boulders. Since I was illiterate and couldn't read ?oE,
I dropped one and waited for a monster to pick it up and read it,
enabling me to solve the level.

